# engines see one site. The mojialand.displayedux.com rules get added once
# mojialand.com is live with HTTPS.
https://mojialand.app/*      https://mojialand.com/:splat  301!
https://www.mojialand.app/*  https://mojialand.com/:splat  301!
https://www.mojialand.com/*  https://mojialand.com/:splat  301!
